description	"Dia Passik

Agile Covert Operator.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 35% Faster Swing Speed
- Dual Shock Batons (Dual/Cyan Style Saber)
-- No Blaster/Saber Defense
-- No Blaster Deflect
-- Pulses/Tracks On Hit
-- Low Damage (80)
- DL-44 Auto Pistol (3)
-- 40%+ RoF
-- 40%- Damage/FP Drain
-- Mag Reload
- E-11 Sweeper Carbine (3)
-- Based On Clone Carbine
-- 30%+ RoF
-- 10%- Damage
-- Primary Fire Only
- Sabotage Trip Mines (3)
-- Ignites/Disarms/Tracks On Hit
- Sonic Detonator (1)

^8Attributes:
- Cloak (2)
- Seeing Stealth
- Knockdown Roll
- Flipkick (2)
- Dexterity (3)
- Slow Faller
- Tracking Beacon
- Blast Armor
- Anti-Mindtrick (2)
- Healing (3)
- Ammo (3)

^8Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Dash (1) ^3[CS2]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS3]
- Flipkick (2) ^3[Contact Jump]
- Disguise (1) ^[Style Swap In Melee]
- Grapple Hook (3) ^3[CS4]
-- Pulls/Slips On Hit"